window.products.push({"id":135586,"name":"Ice Maker Machine Countertop, 40 Lbs/24Hrs, 24 Ice Cubes in 12 Mins, Portable Clear Ice Maker with Scoop for Home, Office (85K, ice Cube Maker, BM)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oly4pbN5S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"12 Mins Quick Ice Cubes - Merax countertop ice maker makes 24 ice cubes in as fast as 12 minutes. With the ice scoop and 2 liter removable ice basket, empty it regularly and you’ll have 40 lbs ice cubes in a single day. Keep you stocked for all your entertaining needs. 3 Ice Sizes for Any Occasions - The thickness of the ice and freezing time can be easily adjusted at the touch of a button, so you can choose from small, medium or large ice cube size depending on your needs. Small ice cubes are perfect for drinks, while the large ice cubes for outdoor activities. When you're done, the ice maker is easy to drain and clean, for fresh and great tasting ice every time. Quality Clear Ice Cubes - Featuring modern refrigeration technology and powerful yet quiet compressor, Merax countertop ice maker produces real clear ice cubes that are harder, denser, and melt much more slowly. Easy 3-Step Operation - Simply turn on the ice machine, add water, and select the ice size, and collect. The light indicator will let you know when the ice is ready, or when it’s time to add more water. To save you the trouble of manually adding water multiple times, you can also connect the ice maker to a faucet (hose included). Compact Countertop Design - Measuring 11.4” x 15” x 14.2 in size, the Merax small ice maker fits neatly on your kitchen counter, office table, or concession stand. Ready to use out of the box. No installation needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oly4pbN5S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merax","source_asin":"B09724TMSK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-135586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09724TMSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09724TMSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
