window.products.push({"id":135776,"name":"Vypart 4\" Louvered Dryer Vent Cover,White Dryer Exhaust Vents Cover,Ensure Maximum Exhaust Airflow,Easy To Install with 4 Screw,For Dryer vent Hose Wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W5mMDhJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Details：The package contains 1X4 inches vent cap for dryer, with 1 x fabric screen and 4 X screws. Vypart louvered vent cap protects the vent from rain and blowing debris, and keeps out insects and small animals. Moreover, the cap restricts lint build-up in the area, making cleaning easier. Dryer vent caps fit onto standard 4-inch-diameter dryer vent pipes. Upgraded Product：The pack comes with the fabric screen which is function as outside lint filter which makes you clean easier. Diameter of the vent cover mounting/opening is about 4 inches, total unit size of the vent cover is almost 6 inches x 6 inches; the \"4 Inches\" refers to the diameter of vent cover mounting/opening, not the total unit size; Therefore, please check and confirm size/diameter of vent duct you have or hole you drill before ordering for your proper use. Easy to Install：If you already have the hole for the cap, then the install will be super easy because the most difficult part of the job is cutting the hole for the end of the pipe where the cap will go. However, if you don’t have hole for cap, no worry about it. We have step by step instruction bellow. Premium Quality：Vypart 4 inches louvered dryer vent cover is made out of sturdy premium quality plastic material, adding the inhibitors for long service time, and preventing it from being age-faded, damaged and cracked, due to the long time exposure to sunlight; attached with strong fabric grill screen, anti-rusty & sturdy. The inside screen also make the out area clean and prevent small animals getting into the pipe. NO WORRY TO BUY- Your satisfaction is our top priority. Thus, we provide a 365-DAYS warranty and a 90-DAYS return & exchange policy. If you have any questions during shopping, feel free to contact us, and we will try our best to solve the problems.Important Installation Tips:Disconnect all the power before starting any repair/replace work!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W5mMDhJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vypart","source_asin":"B097T1MMNC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-135776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097T1MMNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B097T1MMNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
